{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cdd8ac76-0fa5-86d0-a409-2354a670ec18",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T11:10:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Alan Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Kevin, is that K-E-V-I-N? I like to write down who I'm speaking with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it, K-E-V-I-N. Go ahead, what can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. My name is Alan Brownell. I have a few questions about trash and recycling. First, I have an old appliance I need hauled away. It's a dehumidifier that died, and a small chest freezer behind it. Can I just set those out on trash day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a dehumidifier and a chest freezer. Let me take notes here. The freezer is the one I'd be careful about. Anything with a cooling system usually can't just go out with the regular trash, because of the refrigerant. Is the freezer door still on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:07:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me write that down. Freezer, refrigerant, regular trash, no. The door is still on, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:07:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Typically for those you'd schedule a special pickup or bring it to the drop-off area, and they'll want to know it's been emptied and the door's secured or removed. The dehumidifier is the same kind of thing, honestly, it has a compressor. I'd put both down as bulky items and have them sign you up for a pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:07:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So both items are bulky pickup. Is that done through your office, or someone else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can start it from here. I'll need your address, and then I'll put a note in that it's two appliances with refrigerant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The location is 272 Bacheller Street. That's B-A-C-H-E-L-L-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 272 Bacheller. That's in the Fifth Ward. Okay, I've got that noted. Somebody will confirm the pickup date with you. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0171. That's a landline at my shop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, 401-555-0171. I'll put it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Second question. How do I request a replacement bin? The recycling bin has a cracked lid, and the handle came off last week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, we can do that. Is it the recycling bin only, or the trash one too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling only. The trash one is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, replacement recycling bin, damaged lid and handle. I'll add that to the same request at 272 Bacheller so it's all in one place. They usually drop it off at the curb, so you don't need to be home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Let me read that back. Replacement recycling bin, same request, delivered to the curb. Correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:09:01-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more item, and this is more of an observation. The pickup time on my street seems to change. The trucks come by around the time the school pickup starts, and it keeps shifting by about ten minutes, one week to the next. It makes it hard to know when to have the bins out and when the street will be clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:09:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the routes move around a little depending on the load and which truck's running. I don't have a set time I can promise you. The safe bet is to have everything at the curb early in the morning, before the first truck's out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early morning, before the first truck. Is there a time you'd recommend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say the night before or first thing, say by six or so. I'll put a note about the shifting times on your request too, so the supervisor sees it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I appreciate that. Could you read back what you've put down, so I have it correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:09:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Bulky pickup for a dehumidifier and a chest freezer, door secured, at 272 Bacheller Street. Replacement recycling bin, cracked lid and missing handle. Note about the changing pickup times. Callback number 401-555-0171. Anything missing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all of it. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Mr. Brownell. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T11:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
